{"unit_id":"zhangnan__think-like-codex#card-zh","repo":"zhangnan/think-like-codex","commit":"657884bf81fafe7f67404cada274b9fbd5057715","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"think-like-codex 为 DSH 注入中英文任务规划策略。它通过 system prompt 与工具钩子识别复杂改动、自动进入 Plan mode，并要求计划后建立 goal 和 todo。插件还限制探索工具调用，在长回合或重复失败时提醒 Agent 收敛，适合处理多步骤编码任务。需要 DSH 和 Node.js 20 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:123-200","index.js:394-492","index.js:494-549","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangnan__think-like-codex#card-en","repo":"zhangnan/think-like-codex","commit":"657884bf81fafe7f67404cada274b9fbd5057715","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"think-like-codex adds planning policies to DSH. It detects complex changes, can enter Plan mode automatically, and requires a goal and todo list after planning. Tool limits and reminders help agents converge during long turns or repeated failures. It requires Node.js 20 or newer.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:123-200","index.js:394-492","index.js:494-549","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
